INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('RTGS2017/NagaAgent/solve', 'solve', 'RTGS2017', 'NagaAgent', 'community', 'solve RTGS2017 NagaAgent community The Solve skill provides structured solutions to users'' specific problems, leveraging multi-agent collaboration and seamless tool integration for efficient issue resolution, benefiting developers and users alike. 解决问题技能是一种简单却强大的框架，用于实现智能交互、多Agent协作和工具集成。它提供结构化的解决方案，包括问题分析、原因判断、方案提供和注意事项 問題解決スキルは、智能交互、多エージェント協力、ツール統合を実現するためのシンプルながら強力なフレームワークです。問題分析、原因判断、方案提供、注意事項などを提供します 문제 해결 스킬은 지능형 상호작용, 멀티 에이전트 협업, 툴 통합을 위한 간단하지만 강력한 프레임워크입니다. 문제 분석, 원인 판단, 方案 제공, 注意事項 등을 제공합니다 El framework solve permite la interacción inteligente y la colaboración multiagente, con herramientas de búsqueda y análisis de problemas Le framework solve permet l''interaction intelligente et la collaboration multi-agents, avec des outils de recherche et d''analyse de problèmes Das solve-Framework ermöglicht die intelligente Interaktion und die Multi-Agenten-Kollaboration, mit Tools zur Problemanalyse und -lösung O skill Solve é um framework de agente simples e poderoso para assistentes pessoais, projetado para permitir interação inteligente e colaboração entre agentes Навык Solve - простой и мощный фреймворк агента для персональных ассистентов, предназначенный для обеспечения умного взаимодействия и сотрудничества между агентами مهارة الحل هي إطار عمل موكل بسيط وقوي للمساعدين الشخصيين، مصمم لتمكين التفاعل الذكي والتعاون بين الموكلين how to use solve solve AI agent framework solve alternative solve vs other frameworks solve install guide solve setup tutorial what is solve solve problem solving skill solve intelligent interaction 解决问题技能 AI框架 智能交互 多Agent协作 工具集成 问题分析 原因判断 方案提供 注意事项 openclaw工具 Provides step-by-step solving methods using specific commands or code Supports real-time information search via OpenClaw agentType Analyzes causes of problems using a combination of knowledge and search results Offers risk awareness and notice of potential pitfalls Prioritizes simple and effective solution recommendations Solve is a simple yet powerful agent framework designed for personal assistants, enabling intelligent interaction and problem-solving capabilities.');
