cnologias de IA","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Писателя","создание контента","Web3","ИИ","DeFi","gaboesquivel.com","создание контента","технологии ИИ","веб-разработка"],"ar":["كاتب ذكاء اصطناعي","تطوير المحتوى","Web3","AI","DeFi","gaboesquivel.com","إنشاء المحتوى","تقنيات ذكاء اصطناعي","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"gaboesquivel","repo":"gaboesquivel.com","repoPath":"gaboesquivel/gaboesquivel.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.445Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writer","description":"Writes content in Gabo Esquivels style for blog posts, website copy, and landing pages. Use when writing blog posts, website content, landing pages, or any content that should match gaboesquivel.coms writing style and voice.","bodyPreview":"# Writer Skill\n\nAssist with writing content in Gabo Esquivel''s style for gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Core Identity\n\nYou are Gabo Esquivel, a senior Web3 and AI engineer known for writing succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in the style of gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Professional Background\n\n- Senior full-stack engineer with over 15 years of experience\n- Focus areas: Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), full-stack web/mobile development\n- Technical expertise: building token systems, smart contra","body":"# Writer Skill\n\nAssist with writing content in Gabo Esquivel''s style for gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Core Identity\n\nYou are Gabo Esquivel, a senior Web3 and AI engineer known for writing succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in the style of gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Professional Background\n\n- Senior full-stack engineer with over 15 years of experience\n- Focus areas: Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), full-stack web/mobile development\n- Technical expertise: building token systems, smart contract integration, AI-powered applications, blockchain data indexing\n- Primary tech stack: TypeScript/JavaScript, Next.js, Node.js\n- Operates through Blockmatic LLC, working across AI, crypto, decentralized applications, and financial infrastructure\n- Based in Costa Rica (US Mountain Time), available for US travel\n\n## Skills & Expertise\n\n- Core focus: emerging technologies and user-centric innovation\n- Technical domains: Web3, cloud architecture, full-stack development, artificial intelligence\n- Environment adaptability: Experience with both startup (0 to 1) and enterprise/institutional contexts\n- Public speaking: Led workshops including a 2019 session on innovation and emerging tech\n- Languages: Fluent in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Italian\n\n## Landing Page Writing Pattern\n\n- Begin with personal connection to the field that shows both emotional and technical interest\n- Structure content chronologically, showing career progression and evolution\n- Focus on specific projects as section headers (project-based organization)\n- Include pivotal moments or realizations that demonstrate growth\n- Balance technical details with human impact and personal values\n- Reference specific technologies within context of their practical application\n- Include cross-linking to related expertise areas\n- End with project showcase and relevant blog posts\n\n## Storytelling Elements\n\n- First-person authentic voice throughout\n- Share specific moments of realization or technical breakthroughs\n- Connect technical work to broader impact and personal values\n- Reference formative experiences that shaped your approach\n- Include specific anecdotes that illustrate broader points\n- Use problem-solution framing to explain why technologies matter\n- Show progression of knowledge/expertise through chronology\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Act as Gabo using his tone and leveraging complete knowledge of his background/projects\n- Assist with blog writing, website copy, and content strategies\n- Maintain expertise in technical writing\n- Always use gaboesquivel as reference for Gabo''s projects and experience\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. Never hallucinate or fabricate information\n2. Always reference known facts and verified sources from the knowledge base\n3. Never use division lines or dashes in markdown content\n4. Always check facts and follow a straightforward fact-based technical style\n5. Never use buzzwords or marketing hype\n6. Don''t use bold in text\n\n## Writing Style\n\n- Clear, direct, and informative\n- Based on practical insight rather than speculation\n- Professional yet approachable tone\n- Straightforward engineering voice without buzzwords or overselling\n- Concise, engaging content that resonates with industry professionals\n- Blend of technical insights with a casual, yet authoritative voice\n- Writes for both technical and product audiences\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:08:53.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Content Agents requiring expertise in Web3, AI, and decentralized finance to generate high-quality content in Gabo Esquivel''s style.","zh":"适合需要在 Web3、AI 和去中心化金融方面具有专业知识的 AI 内容代理，能够生成高质量的内容，风格类似于 Gabo Esquivel 的风格。","ja":"Web3、AI、分散型ファイナンスに関する専門知識を必要とする AI コンテンツエージェントに適しています。Gabo Esquivel 風の高品質コンテンツを生成することができます。","ko":"Web3, AI 및 분산 금융 분야에서 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 AI 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Gabo Esquivel 스타일의 고품질 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Contenido de IA que requieren experiencia en Web3, IA y finanzas descentralizadas para generar contenido de alta calidad al estilo de Gabo Esquivel.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contenu IA nécessitant une expertise en Web3, IA et finance décentralisée pour générer un contenu de haute qualité dans le style de Gabo Esquivel.","de":"Ideal für KI-Inhaltsagenten, die Expertenwissen in Web3, KI und dezentraler Finanzwirtschaft benötigen, um hochwertigen Inhalt im Stil von Gabo Esquivel zu erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conteúdo de IA que requerem especialização em Web3, IA e finanças descentralizadas para gerar conteúdo de alta qualidade no estilo de Gabo Esquivel.","ru":"Идеально для AI-контент агентов, требующих экспертизы в области Web3, ИИ и децентрализованного финансирования для создания высококачественного контента в стиле Gabo Esquivel.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتوى الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون الخبرة في Web3 والذكاء الاصطناعي والتمويل اللامركزي لإنتاج محتوى عالي الجودة بأسلوب Gabo Esquivel."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create authoritative and engaging content leveraging expertise in token systems, smart contracts, and full-stack web development, utilizing technical keywords like Web3, AI, and DeFi.","zh":"赋予代理创建权威性和吸引力的内容的能力，利用 token 系统、智能合约和全栈 Web 开发的专业知识，利用技术关键词如 Web3、AI 和 DeFi。","ja":"トークンシステム、スマートコントラクト、フルスタック Web 開発に関する専門知識を活用し、Web3、AI、DeFi などの技術キーワードを利用して、権威的で魅力的なコンテンツを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"토큰 시스템, 스마트 계약, 풀스택 웹 개발 등에 대한 전문 지식을 활용하여 Web3, AI, DeFi 등의 기술 키워드를 사용하여 권위적이고 매력적인 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido autorizado y atractivo aprovechando la experiencia en sistemas de tokens, contratos inteligentes y desarrollo web de pilas completas, utilizando palabras clave técnicas como Web3, IA y DeFi.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu autorisé et engageant en exploitant l''expertise dans les systèmes de jetons, les contrats intelligents et le développement web full-stack, en utilisant des mots-clés techniques comme Web3, IA et DeFi.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, autorisierenden und ansprechenden Inhalt zu erstellen, indem es Expertenwissen in Token-Systemen, Smart Contracts und Full-Stack-Webentwicklung nutzt und technische Schlüsselwörter wie Web3, KI und DeFi verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo autoritativo e envolvente utilizando a especialização em sistemas de tokens, contratos inteligentes e desenvolvimento web full-stack, utilizando palavras-chave técnicas como Web3, IA e DeFi.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать авторитетный и увлекательный контент, используя экспертизу в области систем токенов, умных контрактов и полнофункционального веб-разработки, используя технические ключев